            "review_text": "linh t\n3 contributions\n0\nWe had visit a few good food stall and restaurant. Except Ai Hue is big restaurant but disappointed.\nSep 2022 • Family\nMy 2nd time in this restaurant, 3 years ago was my first time. It was not bad. This time Sept 2022, was a bad experience. Food we wanted to order, they don't have it. They only have expensive dish. So we ordered soft shell crab. It had a foul taste. Never again going back there. Foreigner be aware.\nWritten September 24, 2022",
