            "review_text": "L P\n11 contributions\n0\nService and food was bad\nNov 2018 • Family\nFirst time here and my first impression of the restaurant was a mess/ not organize. We have a family of 16 and Have 2 tables. The waiter took our order and already was wrong. It took a while before all of us finally have our drinks correct. My husband places all of the food order and I added an additional dish. Which didn't come out till we were about to settle the bill. They didn't even apologize for the delay. The dish is not even hard to make, it's eggplant with salted fish!!! I would not come back and definitely not recommend this restaurant. Expensive and bad service!!\nRead more\nWritten November 23, 2018",
