            "review_title": "Review at Restaurant Ai Hue 2",
            "review_text": "Duonghannover\nHannover, Germany384 contributions\n0\nThe best chinese food I have ever had!!!\nMar 2018 • Family\nFor my trip to Ho Chi Minh City I was recommended to visit this restaurant. And I am happy that I have been there. Because they serve the best chinese food I have ever had in my life. Even better the ones I had got in Hongkong. Thats why I visited Ai Hue 2 three times in one week.\n\nEach time the restaurant was full of people but the service and the food were excellent!! I booked a table for 10 persons and we got a seperate room on the 6th floor. The whole time we had two services around us and they were very attentively. They pured the tea for us, changed it when it got cold. For many dishes they gave us cleaned plates and bowls.\n\nI ordered a dinner with 8 courses and each of them was very delicious and authetic. For exemple we had a chinese style pigling or abalone with sea cumcumber and green asperarus. But also crabs with ginger or fried rice with five ingredients. And even the dessert was phantastic!!!\n\nThe amount of our bill was not very low but it was absolutely ok for this quality. And I have never been regret to be there. In my opinion areally very high recommended restaurant!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 24, 2018",
